361
00:19:00,962 --> 00:19:04,930
The source attribution identifies the dataset
paper and archive, and the

362
00:19:04,930 --> 00:19:09,174
modification notice explains that trailing
statistical features and aggregate

363
00:19:09,174 --> 00:19:12,592
benchmark results were derived from the
