371
00:19:32,709 --> 00:19:35,100
The final takeaway is deliberately balanced.

372
00:19:35,223 --> 00:19:39,160
The application demonstrates the intended
review flow and makes several failure

373
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:39,907
