374
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:42,894
The synthetic benchmark tests the engineering
pipeline.

375
00:19:43,017 --> 00:19:47,385
The retrospective real benchmark supplies a
modest feasibility check and reveals

376
00:19:47,385 --> 00:19:51,480
substantial false alert workload with
uncertain incremental fusion benefit.

377
00:19:51,602 --> 00:19:54,042
Those are the results the repository supports.

378
00:19:54,165 --> 00:19:58,803
This presentation does not claim registration,
